<title>UK: Merrill Lynch sets warrants on P&amp;O.</title>
<headline>Merrill Lynch sets warrants on P&amp;O.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch International &amp; Co CV has issued 10 million American-style call warrants, on Peninsular &amp; Oriental Steam Navigation Co Ltd, lead manager Merrill Lynch International said.</p>
<p>One warrant controls one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    6.30 STG		  PREMIUM	8.89 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     0.582 STG		 GEARING	10.86 X</p>
<p> MATURITY DATE   14.JAN.98		 PAYDATE	03.FEB.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   LONDON		    MIN EXER LOT 1000</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  6.32 STG</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
